{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2021-12-03 19:24:00', 'title': 'JANSSEN TO SHOWCASE PROGRESS ON RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (RSV) VACCINE CANDIDATE AT ESWI 2021', 'text': 'RARITAN, N.J., DEC. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE\xa0JANSSEN PHARMACEUTICAL COMPANIES OF\xa0JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL PRESENT DATA FROM SIX COMPANY-SPONSORED STUDIES IN SUPPORT OF THEIR RESPIRATORY SYNCYTIAL VIRUS (RSV) ADULT VACCINE CANDIDATE AT THE EIGHTH EUROPEAN SCIENTIFIC WORKING GROUP ON INFLUENZA (ESWI) MEETING.'}